title_en:
A significant step towards strengthening sovereign AI capabilities for India’s Defence Forces.

HQ Integrated Defence Staff and Sarvam #AI have signed a Memorandum of Understanding to collaborate on AI applications, research, knowledge management, training and decision-support across the Indian Army, Navy and Air Force.

The partnership will focus on building secure, sovereign and scalable AI capabilities, with strong emphasis on data sovereignty and ensuring responsible AI based solutions.

#Defence #SovereignAI #IndianArmedForces #Innovation #AtmanirbharBharat 

@DefenceMinIndia 
@SethSanjayMP 
@SpokespersonMoD 
@MIB_India

